{"id": "EUVD-2026-99252", "enisaUuid": "7945b06b-cf46-387c-8468-638df94c4d2d", "description": "iFlytek SkillHub through 0.2.22 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated user to permanently delete other users' skills via DELETE /api/cli/v1/skills/{namespace}/{slug}. Attackers can locate targets through the anonymous search endpoint and trigger deletion without ownership checks, purging all versions, files, reviews, ratings and metadata.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T18:50:01", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T22:28:56", "baseScore": 7.2, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/skillhub-cli-skill-delete-missing-ownership-check", "https://github.com/iflytek/skillhub/blob/v0.2.22/server/skillhub-app/src/main/java/com/iflytek/skillhub/service/SkillDeleteAppService.java#L95-L127", "https://github.com/iflytek/skillhub/blob/v0.2.22/server/skillhub-app/src/main/java/com/iflytek/skillhub/controller/cli/CliSkillController.java#L88-L96", "https://github.com/iflytek/skillhub/blob/v0.2.22/server/skillhub-app/src/main/java/com/iflytek/skillhub/service/cli/CliSkillAppService.java#L149-L161", "https://github.com/iflytek/skillhub", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/skillhub-through-0.2.22-missing-authorization-in-cli-skill-delete-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110211", "GHSA-p68j-4998-6884"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d8df633d-c173-34e8-a7ec-69ff8d44a207", "product": {"name": "skillhub", "vendor": {"name": "iflytek"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.2.22"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4cf558b3-9978-318e-96ac-f0f5f5ecb76c", "vendor": {"name": "iflytek"}}], "isExploited": false}